    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer the call of glory in Mead and Glory, a 2.5D roguelite platformer! Climb a magic tower as a daring adventurer, battling monsters, dodging traps, and gathering loot. Uncover the tower\u2019s past lives and ancient secrets in this indie action-adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AGILITY FIRST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swiftly traverse the randomly generated tower, stacking up epic loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7f966e75a07fae29794fb0c37cc55533.poster.avif?t=1742847320\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7f966e75a07fae29794fb0c37cc55533.webm?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7f966e75a07fae29794fb0c37cc55533.mp4?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GIFTS FROM THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gifts, level up abilities, and power up\u2014or enemies will outscale you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7ac4a892257bd3a141426c03e033898d.poster.avif?t=1742847320\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7ac4a892257bd3a141426c03e033898d.webm?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7ac4a892257bd3a141426c03e033898d.mp4?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE TOWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat realm rulers, claim glory, and explore new places!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/152973ef54be9956f5f8f41f7411cf06.poster.avif?t=1742847320\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/152973ef54be9956f5f8f41f7411cf06.webm?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/152973ef54be9956f5f8f41f7411cf06.mp4?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer the call of glory in Mead and Glory, a 2.5D roguelite platformer! Climb a magic tower as a daring adventurer, battling monsters, dodging traps, and gathering loot. Uncover the tower\u2019s past lives and ancient secrets in this indie action-adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AGILITY FIRST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swiftly traverse the randomly generated tower, stacking up epic loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7f966e75a07fae29794fb0c37cc55533.poster.avif?t=1742847320\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7f966e75a07fae29794fb0c37cc55533.webm?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7f966e75a07fae29794fb0c37cc55533.mp4?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GIFTS FROM THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gifts, level up abilities, and power up\u2014or enemies will outscale you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7ac4a892257bd3a141426c03e033898d.poster.avif?t=1742847320\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7ac4a892257bd3a141426c03e033898d.webm?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/7ac4a892257bd3a141426c03e033898d.mp4?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE TOWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat realm rulers, claim glory, and explore new places!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/152973ef54be9956f5f8f41f7411cf06.poster.avif?t=1742847320\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/152973ef54be9956f5f8f41f7411cf06.webm?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610120/extras/152973ef54be9956f5f8f41f7411cf06.mp4?t=1742847320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
